# 🎨 CSS – Prep2Hire Frontend

This folder contains the CSS files responsible for the visual design and styling of the Prep2Hire frontend.

## 📌 Responsibilities

* Page layouts and structure
* Responsive design
* Navigation styling
* Buttons and forms
* Interview interface styling
* Coding environment styling
* Cards and components
* Animations and transitions
* Dark-themed user interface
* Mobile and desktop responsiveness

## 📁 Contents

```text
css/
├── style.css
├── responsive.css
└── ...
```

The CSS files work together with the HTML pages and JavaScript functionality to provide a consistent user interface throughout Prep2Hire.
